{"id":"torrey:trees","source":"torrey","name":"Trees","slug":"trees","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Originally created by God — Ge 1:11,12; 2:9.","refs":[["Gen",1,11,1,11],["Gen",1,12,1,12],["Gen",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Made for the glory of God — Ps 148:9.","refs":[["Ps",148,9,148,9]]},{"text":"Of the wood. — Song 2:3.","refs":[["Song",2,3,2,3]]},{"text":"Of the forest. — Isa 10:19.","refs":[["Isa",10,19,10,19]]},{"text":"Bearing fruit. — Ne 9:25; Ec 2:5; Eze 47:12.","refs":[["Neh",9,25,9,25],["Eccl",2,5,2,5],["Ezek",47,12,47,12]]},{"text":"Evergreen. — Ps 37:35; Jer 17:2.","refs":[["Ps",37,35,37,35],["Jer",17,2,17,2]]},{"text":"Deciduous or casting the leaves. — Isa 6:13.","refs":[["Isa",6,13,6,13]]},{"text":"Of various sizes — Eze 17:24.","refs":[["Ezek",17,24,17,24]]},{"text":"Given as food to the animal creation — Ge 1:29,30; De 20:19.","refs":[["Gen",1,29,1,29],["Gen",1,30,1,30],["Deut",20,19,20,19]]},{"text":"Designed to beautify the earth — Ge 2:9.","refs":[["Gen",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"The roots. — Jer 17:8.","refs":[["Jer",17,8,17,8]]},{"text":"The stem or trunk. — Isa 11:1; 44:19.","refs":[["Isa",11,1,11,1],["Isa",44,19,44,19]]},{"text":"The branches. — Le 23:40; Da 4:14.","refs":[["Lev",23,40,23,40],["Dan",4,14,4,14]]},{"text":"The tender shoots. — Lu 21:29,30.","refs":[["Luke",21,29,21,29],["Luke",21,30,21,30]]},{"text":"The leaves. — Isa 6:13; Da 4:12; Mt 21:19.","refs":[["Isa",6,13,6,13],["Dan",4,12,4,12],["Matt",21,19,21,19]]},{"text":"The fruit or seeds. — Le 27:30; Eze 36:30.","refs":[["Lev",27,30,27,30],["Ezek",36,30,36,30]]},{"text":"Each kind has its own seed for propagating its species — Ge 1:11,12.","refs":[["Gen",1,11,1,11],["Gen",1,12,1,12]]},{"text":"Often propagated by birds who carry the seeds along with them — Eze 17:3,5.","refs":[["Ezek",17,3,17,3],["Ezek",17,5,17,5]]},{"text":"Planted by man — Le 19:23.","refs":[["Lev",19,23,19,23]]},{"text":"Each kind of, known by its fruit — Mt 12:33.","refs":[["Matt",12,33,12,33]]},{"text":"By the earth. — Ge 1:12; 2:9.","refs":[["Gen",1,12,1,12],["Gen",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"By the rain from heaven. — Isa 44:14.","refs":[["Isa",44,14,44,14]]},{"text":"Through their own sap. — Ps 104:16.","refs":[["Ps",104,16,104,16]]},{"text":"Specially flourished beside the rivers and streams of water — Eze 47:12.","refs":[["Ezek",47,12,47,12]]},{"text":"When cut down often sprouted from their roots again — Job 14:7.","refs":[["Job",14,7,14,7]]},{"text":"Were sold with the land on which they grew — Ge 23:17.","refs":[["Gen",23,17,23,17]]},{"text":"Locusts. — Ex 10:5,15; De 28:42.","refs":[["Exod",10,5,10,5],["Exod",10,15,10,15],["Deut",28,42,28,42]]},{"text":"Hail and frost. — Ex 9:25; Ps 78:47.","refs":[["Exod",9,25,9,25],["Ps",78,47,78,47]]},{"text":"Fire. — Joe 1:19.","refs":[["Joel",1,19,1,19]]},{"text":"Desolating armies. — 2Ki 19:23; Isa 10:34.","refs":[["2Kgs",19,23,19,23],["Isa",10,34,10,34]]},{"text":"Afford an agreeable shade in eastern countries during the heat of the day — Ge 18:4; Job 40:21.","refs":[["Gen",18,4,18,4],["Job",40,21,40,21]]},{"text":"With axes. — De 19:5; Ps 74:5; Mt 3:10.","refs":[["Deut",19,5,19,5],["Ps",74,5,74,5],["Matt",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"For building. — 2Ki 6:2; 2Ch 2:8,10.","refs":[["2Kgs",6,2,6,2],["2Chr",2,8,2,8],["2Chr",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"By besieging armies for erecting forts. — De 20:20; Jer 6:6.","refs":[["Deut",20,20,20,20],["Jer",6,6,6,6]]},{"text":"For making idols. — Isa 40:20; 44:14,17.","refs":[["Isa",40,20,40,20],["Isa",44,14,44,14],["Isa",44,17,44,17]]},{"text":"For fuel. — Isa 44:14-16; Mt 3:10.","refs":[["Isa",44,14,44,16],["Matt",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"God increases and multiplies the fruit of, for his people — Le 26:4; Eze 34:27; Joe 2:22.","refs":[["Lev",26,4,26,4],["Ezek",34,27,34,27],["Joel",2,22,2,22]]},{"text":"God often renders, barren as a punishment — Le 26:20.","refs":[["Lev",26,20,26,20]]},{"text":"Early custom of planting, in consecrated grounds — Ge 21:33.","refs":[["Gen",21,33,21,33]]},{"text":"Prohibited from planting in consecrated places. — De 16:21.","refs":[["Deut",16,21,16,21]]},{"text":"Prohibited from cutting down fruit bearing, for sieges. — De 20:19.","refs":[["Deut",20,19,20,19]]},{"text":"Often pitched their tents under. — Ge 18:1,4; Jdj 4:5; 1Sa 22:6.","refs":[["Gen",18,1,18,1],["Gen",18,4,18,4],["Judg",4,5,4,5],["1Sam",22,6,22,6]]},{"text":"Often buried under. — Ge 35:8; 1Sa 21:13.","refs":[["Gen",35,8,35,8],["1Sam",21,13,21,13]]},{"text":"Often executed criminals on. — De 21:22,23; Jos 10:26; Ga 3:13; Ge 40:19.","refs":[["Deut",21,22,21,22],["Deut",21,23,21,23],["Josh",10,26,10,26],["Gal",3,13,3,13],["Gen",40,19,40,19]]},{"text":"Considered trees on which criminals were executed abominable. — Isa 14:19.","refs":[["Isa",14,19,14,19]]},{"text":"Almond. — Ge 43:11; Ec 12:5; Jer 1:11.","refs":[["Gen",43,11,43,11],["Eccl",12,5,12,5],["Jer",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Almug or algum. — 1Ki 10:11,12; 2Ch 9:10,11.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,11,10,11],["1Kgs",10,12,10,12],["2Chr",9,10,9,10],["2Chr",9,11,9,11]]},{"text":"Apple. — Song 2:3; 8:5; Joe 1:12.","refs":[["Song",2,3,2,3],["Song",8,5,8,5],["Joel",1,12,1,12]]},{"text":"Ash. — Isa 44:14.","refs":[["Isa",44,14,44,14]]},{"text":"Bay. — Ps 37:35.","refs":[["Ps",37,35,37,35]]},{"text":"Box. — Isa 41:19.","refs":[["Isa",41,19,41,19]]},{"text":"Cedar. — 1Ki 10:27.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,27,10,27]]},{"text":"Chestnut. — Eze 31:8.","refs":[["Ezek",31,8,31,8]]},{"text":"Cyprus. — Isa 44:14.","refs":[["Isa",44,14,44,14]]},{"text":"Fig. — De 8:8.","refs":[["Deut",8,8,8,8]]},{"text":"Fir. — 1Ki 5:10; 2Ki 19:23; Ps 104:17.","refs":[["1Kgs",5,10,5,10],["2Kgs",19,23,19,23],["Ps",104,17,104,17]]},{"text":"Juniper. — 1Ki 19:4,5.","refs":[["1Kgs",19,4,19,4],["1Kgs",19,5,19,5]]},{"text":"Lign-aloes. — Nu 24:6.","refs":[["Num",24,6,24,6]]},{"text":"Mulberry. — 2Sa 5:23,24.","refs":[["2Sam",5,23,5,23],["2Sam",5,24,5,24]]},{"text":"Myrtle. — Isa 41:19; 55:13; Zec 1:8.","refs":[["Isa",41,19,41,19],["Isa",55,13,55,13],["Zech",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Mustard. — Mt 13:32.","refs":[["Matt",13,32,13,32]]},{"text":"Oak. — Isa 1:30.","refs":[["Isa",1,30,1,30]]},{"text":"Oil-tree. — Isa 41:19.","refs":[["Isa",41,19,41,19]]},{"text":"Olive. — De 6:11.","refs":[["Deut",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"Palm. — Ex 15:27.","refs":[["Exod",15,27,15,27]]},{"text":"Pine. — Isa 41:19.","refs":[["Isa",41,19,41,19]]},{"text":"Pomegranate. — De 8:8; Joe 1:12.","refs":[["Deut",8,8,8,8],["Joel",1,12,1,12]]},{"text":"Shittah or shittim. — Ex 36:20; Isa 41:19.","refs":[["Exod",36,20,36,20],["Isa",41,19,41,19]]},{"text":"Sycamore. — 1Ki 10:27; Ps 78:47; Am 7:14; Lu 19:4.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,27,10,27],["Ps",78,47,78,47],["Amos",7,14,7,14],["Luke",19,4,19,4]]},{"text":"Teil. — Isa 6:13.","refs":[["Isa",6,13,6,13]]},{"text":"Vine. — Nu 6:4; Eze 15:2.","refs":[["Num",6,4,6,4],["Ezek",15,2,15,2]]},{"text":"Willow. — Isa 44:4; Eze 17:5.","refs":[["Isa",44,4,44,4],["Ezek",17,5,17,5]]},{"text":"Solomon wrote the history of — 1Ki 4:33.","refs":[["1Kgs",4,33,4,33]]},{"text":"Of Christ. — Ro 11:24; Re 2:7; 22:2,14.","refs":[["Rom",11,24,11,24],["Rev",2,7,2,7],["Rev",22,2,22,2],["Rev",22,14,22,14]]},{"text":"Of wisdom. — Pr 3:18.","refs":[["Prov",3,18,3,18]]},{"text":"Of kings, &c. — Isa 10:34; Eze 17:24; 31:7-10; Da 4:10-14.","refs":[["Isa",10,34,10,34],["Ezek",17,24,17,24],["Ezek",31,7,31,10],["Dan",4,10,4,14]]},{"text":"Of the life and conversation of the righteous. — Pr 11:30; 15:4.","refs":[["Prov",11,30,11,30],["Prov",15,4,15,4]]},{"text":"(Green,) of the innocence of Christ. — Lu 23:31.","refs":[["Luke",23,31,23,31]]},{"text":"(Good and fruitful,) of saints. — Nu 24:6; Ps 1:3; Isa 61:3; Jer 17:8; Mt 7:17,18.","refs":[["Num",24,6,24,6],["Ps",1,3,1,3],["Isa",61,3,61,3],["Jer",17,8,17,8],["Matt",7,17,7,17],["Matt",7,18,7,18]]},{"text":"(Evergreen,) of saints. — Ps 1:1-3.","refs":[["Ps",1,1,1,3]]},{"text":"(Duration of,) of continued prosperity of saints. — Isa 65:22.","refs":[["Isa",65,22,65,22]]},{"text":"(Casting their leaves yet retaining their substance,) of the elect remnant in the church. — Isa 6:13.","refs":[["Isa",6,13,6,13]]},{"text":"(Barren,) of the wicked. — Ho 9:16.","refs":[["Hos",9,16,9,16]]},{"text":"(Shaking of the leaves off,) of the terror of the wicked. — Isa 7:2.","refs":[["Isa",7,2,7,2]]},{"text":"(Producing evil fruit,) of the wicked. — Mt 7:17-19.","refs":[["Matt",7,17,7,19]]},{"text":"(Dry,) of useless persons. — Isa 56:3.","refs":[["Isa",56,3,56,3]]},{"text":"(Dry,) of the wicked ripe for judgment. — Lu 23:31.","refs":[["Luke",23,31,23,31]]}],"refCount":158}
